        "heading": "Why YouTube Ads Work So Well",
        "sub_heading": "The targeting, the reach, the results — all in one platform.",
        "text": "<p>YouTube lets us put your offer in front of people who are already searching, watching, and buying in your niche. It's not just about views — it’s about intent. We build campaigns that hit buyers, not browsers.<br/><br/><strong>Google’s Data = Smarter Targeting</strong><br/>Tap into the same intent signals that power Google Ads — keywords, search history, website activity — and run video ads that actually convert.<br/><br/><strong>Affordable, High-Quality Reach</strong><br/>Compared to other platforms, YouTube gets you in front of more people for less — especially when it’s set up right. That’s where we come in.<br/><br/><strong>Perfect for Shopify & Lead Gen</strong><br/>Whether you're pushing product demos, explainer videos, or trust-building service ads — YouTube has the flexibility to grow any business with the right funnel behind it.</p>",
        "button_link": "shopify://pages/contact",
        "button_text": "Help Grow My Business",
        "image_right": true,
