        "text": "<p>Most agencies throw your video ad on YouTube and hope for the best. Not us. We build campaigns that get watched, clicked, and remembered. It’s not about vanity metrics — it’s about visibility, trust, and sales. Whether you're running a Shopify store or a service business, we know how to turn views into leads and leads into conversions.</p><p>We’ve run hundreds of performance-driven YouTube campaigns, and we know what it takes to win on the platform — creative strategy, audience targeting, testing, and tight optimisation.</p>",
