          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do I need a Google Ads account to run YouTube Ads?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, you'll need a Google Ads account to set up and manage your YouTube advertising campaigns. ​</p>",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/yellow-arrow.svg"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_E6VP9h": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What types of YouTube Ads are available?",
            "answer": "<p>YouTube offers various ad formats, including skippable and non-skippable in-stream ads, bumper ads, and video discovery ads.</p>",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/yellow-arrow.svg"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_akFz96": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I know if my YouTube Ads are effective?",
            "answer": "<p>You can track performance using metrics like impressions, views, click-through rates, and conversions within your Google Ads dashboard.</p>",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/yellow-arrow.svg"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_jdQR46": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I target specific audiences with YouTube Ads?",
            "answer": "<p>Absolutely. You can target based on demographics, interests, search history, and more to reach your ideal audience. </p>",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/yellow-arrow.svg"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_nyFTVE": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Are YouTube Ads suitable for small businesses?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, YouTube Ads can be tailored to fit small business budgets and objectives, making them a viable option for businesses of all sizes. </p>",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/yellow-arrow.svg"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_XN9Db9": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long should my YouTube Ad be?",
            "answer": "<p>Ad length depends on the format. Skippable ads can be longer, but it's recommended to keep them concise. Non-skippable ads are typically 15-20 seconds, and bumper ads are 6 seconds.</p>",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/yellow-arrow.svg"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_C7MHEi": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I run YouTube Ads without a video?",
            "answer": "<p>No, since YouTube is a video platform, you'll need video content to run ads. However, you can create simple videos using various tools if you don't have existing content.​</p><p></p>",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/yellow-arrow.svg"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_Htp8HR": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I choose the right ad format for my goals?",
            "answer": "<p>Your choice depends on your objectives. For brand awareness, bumper or non-skippable ads work well. For engagement or conversions, skippable in-stream ads might be more effective.</p>",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/yellow-arrow.svg"
          }
        },
